# Fuzz harnesses + attack corpora. #1032 deleted the entire fuzz/ tree
# unattended — including the attack corpora (ext-sh-c-id, o-proxycommand,
# cat-ssh-id-rsa, cat-aws-credentials) — under a "Redact Telegram tokens"
# title. Requiring code-owner review on this path prevents that class of
# silent removal.
/fuzz/                                  @beer-sakthai

